An explanation of eye diseases related to daily life Health relieved seminar Hiramatsu Hospital Kinoshita Ophthalmology Director|Town Topics|Saga Shimbun News|Saga Shimbun LiVE
Akio Kinoshita, head of ophthalmology at Hiramatsu Hospital who explained the dry eyes, etc. = Yonezawa Saga Main Store of Glasses in Saga City
