"This month's pocket money, I'm not good enough, but ..." My husband told me that I'm scared, or I'm an angry wife, isn't there?
The family in which this conversation takes place is a family in which the wife holds the wallet.
How many people in the world have a wife holding her wallet?
In addition, let’s take a look at the percentage of “marriage-separated wallets” and “co-manipternity management”.
Who owns your household portfolio?
Matsui Securities Co., Ltd. conducted an Internet survey of 400 men and women (young couples) in their twenties and thirties (young-aged couples) in their twenties and thirties (married couples) within three years of marriage nationwide.
Who owns a household wallet?
Wife: 45.0% Husband: 24.8% This resulted in the largest number of households in which the wife manages the household.
No matter where you manage it, it seems that there are various episodes, although there are many twists and turns.
The wife manages the household budget: In the case of A-ko-san Ako-san is an arraign-mama who has a daughter in the third year of high school and a daughter in the first year of high school.
My son is in full control of his household budget.
In preparation for the university entrance exam, there were many months in which there was an increase in the number of months in which the number of cram school fees ran out, so I negotiated with my husband to lower my pocket money, but I resisted.
At that time, he said, "Let me show you what kind of expenses it is," so I showed them the household books.
I should have listed all my expenses, but when I looked at the household books, I didn't have enough money to become a deficit.
My husband seemed to be able to come close to me, but Ako-san thought, "Okay, I don't have enough household management, so please take care of everything."
At a later date, Ako-san interviewed her husband, "Although I am dissatisfied with the fact that it is managed such as pocket money, it is true that I do not have the time and energy to manage a variety of household expenses (e.g., school teaching materials and PTA expenses).
The husband manages the household budget: In the case of Ms. B, a housewielding housewielding housewives are being given the cost of living by their husbands and managing them every day.
In the spring of last year, the freezer part of the refrigerator was broken, so I asked my husband to buy a refrigerator.
However, my husband said, "The freezer is not good, but it's okay because the refrigerated part can still be used."
However, in the middle of the summer, my husband himself wanted to create an environment where he could eat ice cream at any time, "Let's buy a refrigerator, after all."
Mr. B complained to his friends that his husband was succulent so that he couldn’t help it.
Takehide KUBO's transfer destination was narrowed down to the first five clubs in Spain (Higashi Spo Web) - Yahoo! News
It seems that Japanese midfielder Takehide Kubo (19), who has played for the Spanish club Mallorca this season, has been gradually narrowed down.
Mallorca were relegated to the 2nd division, but Kubo's ratings skyrocketed at the end-of-season.
However, it will be difficult to return to Real Madrid, which has a "holding rights" due to the relationship between the outer EU, so he is scheduled to play for other clubs next season next season.
We have already received an offer from about thirty clubs, but R-Madrid plans to train as a warrior at a domestic club.
The Spanish newspaper "Marquica" reported that "five clubs are interested in Kubo's acquisition of Kubo, but R Madrid wants a club that is more than the middle of the league" as a transfer destination for Kubo, Villarreal, Granada, Getafe and Betis.
Villarreal and R-Sociedad have qualified for the Europa League (EL) next season, and Granada will also participate from the 2nd round of the EL qualifiers and meet the team's requirements by R Madrid.
What kind of decision will the world's number one biggest club make for the departure of the "treasures of Japan"?
Detection of sedative drugs from the body of ALS Unintervened and administered via gastroenterpized: Hokkaido Shimbun Doshin Electronic Version
In a case in which a female patient with amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS), an intractable atrophic lateral sclerocculosis (ALS), received a request from a female patient for administering a drug and killing it on suspicion of homicide, Dr. Yuichi Okubo (42) and Naoki YAMAMOTO (43), both of whom were arrested, in a case in which a sedative "barbituric acid system" sedative drug was detected from the woman's body.
The prefectural police believe that a sedative medicine was administered from 'gastric ro,' which puts nutrients into the stomach with a tube.
According to medical personnel, barbituronic acid-based drugs are used to treat epilepsy and are not commercially available.
When administered in large quantities, it suppresses breathing and leads to death, and in Europe and the U.S., it is used by assisted-suicidal organizations.
The body of the Oita-gawa River turned out to be a ryokan business man Seventy-seven dead due to torrential rains in Kyushu|SHIZUOKA SHIMBUN AT-S
On the 25th, Oita Prefecture announced that it had confirmed the identity of the body, which was found on the 23rd in the Oita River in Yufu City in Yufu City on the 23rd, and Kenta Watanabe (28), a ryokan dealer who was missing due to torrential rain, was identified as Yudaira, Yufuin-cho, the same city.
There were a total of four deaths in the prefecture as a result of torrential rains, and a total of seventy-seven deaths in Kyushu.
On the 25th, the prefectural government also revealed that it had found the bodies of an undisputed person, both in terms of gender and age, at Takeyabu in Shonaihara, Shonai-cho in the same city.
It is believed to be one of Watanabe's parents who do not know where the body is going, and is working to confirm the identity and determine the cause of death.
From the middle of the night on the 7th to the 8th, Mr. Watanabe and others were swept away by a river with increased water for each car.
Watanabe's body was found near the opposite bank where his grandmother Toshimi (81) was found.
Disney Announces Postponement of “Mulan” “Avatar” and “Star Wars” also postponed (cinemacafe.net) - Yahoo! News
A few days ago, in the United States, where there are no signs of a convergence of the new coronavirus infection, Warner Bros. decided to postpone the release of Christopher Nooran's directorial "TENET Tenet".
“Avatar” and “Star Wars” have also been postponed.
On the 23rd (local time), Disney also announced the postponement of "Mulan" in accordance with Warner.
The film was originally scheduled to be released nationwide on March 27th, and has since changed its release date on July 24th and August 21st.
A spokesperson for Disney said: “It’s been difficult to determine how the film is going to be made in the midst of such a global health crisis over the past few months, so we’d like to pause the release of Mulan and think about how we can effectively see it for audiences all over the world.”
In addition to "Mulan", there are works at Disney that have been postponed due to their release.
"Avatar", more than ten years from the previous work, is one of them.
The director, James Cameron, posted a letter on Twitter.
“Everything was going well until the outbreak of the new coronavirus, and it was scheduled to be released in December this year,” he said, noting that there was a significant delay in the production of the same work.
"Avatar" is scheduled to be released in December 2022, a year in 2022, the third is in 2024, the fourth is in 2026, and the fifth is expected to be in 2028.
It will also be a one-year pre-delayed new Star Wars trilogy, and the first will be in December 2023, the second in 2025 and the third in 2027.
On the evening of the 24th of July, on the night of July 24th, Ichijodani Asakura clan ruins in Fukui City in Fukui City, Fukui Prefecture
On the night of July 24th, one year until the opening of the Tokyo Olympics, which was postponed due to the spread of the new coronavirus, a nationwide fireworks display event was held by the Japan Youth Chamber (JC) in an attempt to brighten up society as much as possible.
In Fukui Prefecture, the weather was unfortunately rainy, but it was launched as scheduled in nine places and colored the summer night sky.
The JC appealed to various block councils across the country to overcome the sense of obstruction due to the spread of the infection and serve as a signal for Japan to be reborn.
It started at eight o'clock in the afternoon at 117 locations in forty-six prefectures.
At Ichijodani Asakura clan ruins in Fukui City, a total of 53 shots of 2 to 4 balls were launched for about two minutes while the surrounding mountains were covered with haze.
With the light of the fireworks, the Karamon Gate appeared in the middle of the night, creating a fantastic atmosphere.
It was also performed on the Matsubara Beach in Tsuruga City and along the Mana River in Ono City.
In order to prevent infection, we did not pre-announce the launch site in order to avoid the large number of spectators.
